    diagnostics:
        - message: '`deriv()` needs a window of at least 20m with the `10m` scrape_interval of `prom` VictoriaMetrics server at https://simple.example.com: `deriv()` only uses samples inside the window, so it needs two scrape intervals. A `[15m]` window can have a single sample, so it can return no results or wrong ones.'
