                VictoriaMetrics server at https://simple.example.com (its slowest series in the last 15m,
                measured with `scrape_interval()`; `scrapeInterval` in pint config is 1m): VictoriaMetrics
                uses the sample before the window only if it's at most 5m before the window. A `[5m]` window
