    diagnostics:
        - message: '`rollup_rate()` needs a window of at least 15m with samples of `foo` every 10m on `prom` VictoriaMetrics server at https://simple.example.com (its slowest series in the last 15m, measured with `scrape_interval()`; `scrapeInterval` in pint config is 1m): VictoriaMetrics uses the sample before the window only if it''s at most 5m before the window. A `[5m]` window can miss the samples `rollup_rate()` needs, so it can return `0` or nothing instead of the real value.'
